flowchart TD

    TARGET["Desired Motion<br/>Speed / Direction / Turn"]

    CMD["Motion Command"]

    PID["PID / Motion Controller"]

    MOTOR_CMD["Motor PWM / Direction Command"]

    DRIVER["TB6612FNG<br/>Motor Driver"]

    MOTORS["Left + Right Motors"]

    ROBOT["Robot Motion"]

    ENC["Wheel Encoders"]

    IR["IR Wall Sensors"]

    MPU["MPU6050<br/>Orientation Feedback"]

    FEEDBACK["Feedback Processing"]

    ERROR["Motion Error / Correction"]

    TARGET --> CMD
    CMD --> PID
    PID --> MOTOR_CMD
    MOTOR_CMD --> DRIVER
    DRIVER --> MOTORS
    MOTORS --> ROBOT

    ROBOT --> ENC
    ROBOT --> IR
    ROBOT --> MPU

    ENC --> FEEDBACK
    IR --> FEEDBACK
    MPU --> FEEDBACK

    FEEDBACK --> ERROR
    ERROR --> PID
